# ========================================================
# Flyora Monorepo — Environment Variables Guide
# ========================================================
#
# Each app manages its own .env file.
# Copy the relevant .env.example from the app directory.
#
# Backend API  →  apps/api/.env.example
# Web (Next.js) →  apps/web/.env.local (if needed, e.g. NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL)
# Admin (Vite)  →  apps/admin/.env (if needed, e.g. VITE_API_URL)
#
# ========================================================